{#-
  riskrank Markdown report template (R029).

  Rendered by riskrank.report.markdown (R030). Context:

    report.target_url        str
    report.scanned_at        str, e.g. "2026-09-24 10:15 UTC"
    report.riskrank_version  str
    report.total_findings    int   raw scanner findings
    report.issue_count       int   distinct issues after grouping by type
    report.summary           list of {tier, issues, occurrences}, Critical -> Low, then "Not triaged"
    report.fix_first         list[Issue]  Critical + High, highest score first
    report.other             list[Issue]  Medium + Low
    report.untriaged         list[Issue]  no AI scores (triage skipped or failed)

  Issue (one per finding type, merging every endpoint it was found on):
    rank, type, tier, score, exploitability, impact, severity_raw, cwe_id,
    explanation, suggested_fix, evidence, occurrences,
    endpoints (list[str], capped), more_endpoints (int, how many were cut)

  Filters (riskrank.report.markdown): md (escape inline Markdown),
  inline_code (backtick span safe for any content), code_block (fenced block
  safe for any content), cwe_link (89 -> link to cwe.mitre.org).
-#}
